# DESK22 -- the `.NCP` launch from the desktop (main::launch_native, the
# ftype::Flavor::Console arm). Same gesture as
# measurement-2026-09-23-desk06/method/desk06-redraw.actions, with the icon
# coordinate re-measured on THIS card image (d-probe run, serial line
# "[probe]   obj 25 'HELLO.NCP' box (141,171) 76x40 -> click (179,187)").
#
# The picture that decides the ticket is C_PROGRAM: the text screen while the
# console program's output stands and the desktop waits in
# `console_pause_for_key`. The pointer last moved to (179,187) -- the icon it
# double-clicked -- so that is where the black smudge sits in the "before"
# build and where nothing may be in the "after" build.
#
#   C: drive icon click (38,35) from the same dump; any key ends the
#   pause, SPACE = IKBD make 0x39 / break 0xB9.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 38 35
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
2900 mark B_WINDOW
3200 move 179 187
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4600 mark C_PROGRAM
4900 key 39
4930 key b9
5600 move 600 240
6400 mark D_AFTER_NCP
